  Convention: Underwood (1997), Cornfield-Tukey; restricted interactions
  EMS(gen) = 1 s2 + 4 s2(gen:loc:year) + 20 s2(gen:year) + 12 s2(gen:loc)
    + 60 s2(gen)
  EMS(loc) = 1 s2 + 15 s2(loc:year:rep) + 4 s2(gen:loc:year)
    + 60 s2(loc:year) + 12 s2(gen:loc) + 180 s2(loc)
