\subsection{Multi-environment trials: Balanced and unbalanced }
\label{sec:met-balanced-means}
\mbox{\cde{M37: barley-met}}

\medskip\noindent
The supplied barley data form a balanced reference for genotype means.
The table counts usable TKW records by location and year. Each of the
15 environments contains 15 genotypes in four replicates, so the means
can be estimated across all 15 environments.

<<M37_NA_NA-data,eval=FALSE>>=
data("v-lmm-barley-met", package = "SelectionTools")
xtabs(~loc + year, data = barley.met, subset = !is.na(TKW))
@

\begin{Soutput}
     year
loc   y2016 y2017 y2018
  HOH    60    60    60
  EWE    60    60    60
  EIN    60    60    60
  OLI    60    60    60
  HFH    60    60    60
\end{Soutput}

<<M37_NA_NA-1,eval=FALSE>>=
m <- st.lmm(
    fixed = TKW ~ gen + loc + year + loc:year + year:loc:rep,
    random = ~gen:loc + gen:year + gen:loc:year,
    data = barley.met
)
m
@

