\subsubsection{Environment model for genotype means}
\label{sec:met-observed-means}
\mbox{\cde{M39: RLab-PopGen/q046-10-s3.R}}

\medskip\noindent
Two location--year combinations are absent. Each of the ten observed
environments has usable yields for 15 genotypes in three replicates.
The model uses one \cde{env} level per observed environment, so the
genotype means are estimable across those ten environments.

