\subsection{Nested incomplete blocks: Barley lattice}
\label{sec:barley-lattice-nested}
\mbox{\cde{M07: RLab-AppStat/v14-u51.R}}

\medskip\noindent
The original lattice analysis includes random effects for replicates and
incomplete blocks nested within replicates. In \cde{barley.lattice},
\cde{RowBlk} identifies these incomplete blocks.

<<M07_NA_NA-1,eval=FALSE>>=
