\end{Soutput}

The means for G01 and G02 combine several error strata, giving
Satterthwaite DF. For their difference, the shared environment
effects cancel, and the genotype-by-environment stratum gives the
exact DF for each trait.

<<maize-moments-means-two,eval=FALSE>>=
st.lsm(
