\subsection{Unbalanced trial with seven traits and heterogeneous environments in barley}
\mbox{\cde{M47: RLab-PopGen/q046-30-s1.R}}

\medskip\noindent
The call \cde{data("v-lmm-barley-seven-traits", package = "SelectionTools")}
loads \cde{barley.seven.traits}, which contains the model factors and
291 plots with measurements for all seven traits, for a total of 2,037
response values. The first table gives the number of plots in each
replicate within each environment.

