  x.1         1   32   291.0441   291.0441   3.0239  0.0917
  x.2         1   32  1060.1284  1060.1284  11.0145  0.0023
  Residual   32       3079.9400    96.2481                 

Fixed-effect regression estimates (exact t):
  Coefficient  Estimate       SE  DF       t       p
  (Intercept)   34.6257  20.6344  32  1.6781  0.1031
  x.1            0.4387   0.2523  32  1.7389  0.0917
  x.2            0.2173   0.0655  32  3.3188  0.0023

Model statistics:
  Trait        N  Residual DF      R2  Adjusted R2  Residual SD
  y      35.0000           32  0.3564       0.3162       9.8106
\end{Soutput}

