\cde{st.predict} extracts the genotype predictions from the fitted model.
The \cde{"gen"} request returns the fixed intercept plus the genotype
effect; the additional environment, replicate, block and interaction
terms remain in the fitted model.

<<tropmaize-lattice-one-step-predict,eval=FALSE>>=
maize.lattice.one.pred <- st.predict(maize.lattice.one.step, "gen")
maize.lattice.one.pred
@

