  BIC                    7567.2204    Variance: random         52.1114
  R-squared (marginal)      0.0000    Variance: residual       17.8369
\end{Soutput}


This call separately evaluates conditional predictions for the rows in
\cde{hybrid.performance}. Its \cde{fit} matrix is saved as
\cde{gca.predictions}, in the order of that performance frame.

<<H02-predict,eval=FALSE>>=
gca.predictions <- predict(
    hybrid.gca,
    newdata = hybrid.performance,
    type = "conditional"
)$fit
gca.predictions
