\end{Soutput}

The masked yield values in the performance frame are counted in
\cde{gca.missing.phenotypes}.

<<H02-missing-phenotypes,eval=FALSE>>=
gca.missing.phenotypes <- sum(is.na(hybrid.performance$GY))
